# Un-ignore artifacts/metrics/ specifically: it's small (~360KB) and
# metrics.json is read at runtime by /api/models and the dashboard's
# "live traffic vs. training distribution" chart -- the model weights
# themselves stay excluded (fetched from a GitHub Release instead).
!artifacts/metrics/
!artifacts/metrics/**
tests/
*.md
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
